  "decision": "Retain v613 as the current source-true technical verification frame. It preserves the accepted v595 spray distribution, v600 source-equivalent boulder restoration, v601 skeletal-neoprene override, v606 captured-sky fill, and v610 raft wet-film/static-mesh correction. It keeps every rights-tracked 2K skin atlas and skeletal slot while adding restrained preintegrated skin, micro-normal, and varied roughness response without changing body geometry, pose, D4, rescue, or water authority. The v612 orange-transmission branch was rejected. Reject v613 for photoreal, marketing, store, press, and human approval because low-detail character topology, facial expression/animation, hands, hair and PPE integration, parametric raft construction and remaining broad highlight, boulder, broad water, aerosol, shoreline, terrain, and overall lighting remain visibly synthetic or unfinished."
